            "title": "A Cure Almost No One Can Buy",
            "body": "Casgevy lists at about $2.2 million, and delivering it needs a transplant ward, chemotherapy conditioning, and months of care. Most people with sickle cell disease live in sub-Saharan Africa. A therapy reaching a few hundred patients has solved a scientific problem and not yet a human one.",
