            "type": "example",
            "title": "Personality by Transplant",
            "body": "In 2011 Premysl Bercik's team swapped gut communities between two mouse strains, one timid and one bold. The recipients' exploratory behaviour shifted toward that of their donors. Later groups transferred microbiota from depressed patients into germ-free rodents and reported depression-like behaviour. In mice, these effects are real.",
            "art": "puzzle"
