              "Most of your serotonin is made in the gut, but it does not cross into the brain.",
              "In mice, transplanted microbiota can transfer behaviour, and cutting the vagus abolishes the effect.",
              "Human evidence is mostly correlational or from small short trials; no psychobiotic is an approved treatment.",
