            "type": "concept",
            "title": "What Makes a Thing 'News'",
            "body": "Editors sort a near-infinite world with a few working filters: is it new, is there conflict, is it near our readers, is a prominent person involved? Nothing sinister — these are the questions any reader would ask. But a filter is a shape, and everything that passes through comes out shaped like it.",
