            "type": "concept",
            "title": "Four Things That Look Alike",
            "body": "Reporting establishes what happened. Analysis explains what it means. Opinion argues what should be done. Sponsored content is an advertisement built to resemble the other three. In print these lived on separate pages. In a feed they arrive in the same rectangle, in the same font.",
