            "title": "Paid in Attention",
            "body": "Reporting costs money, and most of that money arrives as attention — from advertisers, subscribers, or both. Attention pays for the courthouse reporter. It also rewards whatever gets opened. No cynicism is required for this to bend coverage: any business makes more of what sells.",
